WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.230 --> 00:14.460
[Ryu Seil]

3
00:18.880 --> 00:22.340
[Ha Junghoon]

4
00:26.410 --> 00:29.660
[Lee Jungchan]

5
00:33.480 --> 00:36.980
[Jeong Siwan]

6
00:42.340 --> 00:47.020
[Boy, with Caution]

7
00:50.790 --> 00:52.800
Any discussion of correctness is from an ethical perspective.

8
00:52.800 --> 00:53.780
Memorize this.

9
00:54.320 --> 00:55.680
Looking at that,

10
00:55.900 --> 00:57.510
integrating all these

11
00:57.810 --> 00:59.710
is the comprehensive perspective.

12
00:59.710 --> 01:02.950
Comprehensive perspective.

13
01:05.500 --> 01:06.590
Okay, then,

14
01:07.040 --> 01:09.840
how many perspectives do we have on human society?

15
01:32.710 --> 01:34.440
Why did you submit a blank form?

16
01:36.729 --> 01:38.210
There's nothing to write.

17
01:39.729 --> 01:41.110
Then just write "None."

18
01:41.520 --> 01:42.650
College I want to apply to: none.

19
01:42.650 --> 01:44.340
Further education intention: none.

20
01:44.340 --> 01:47.039
But you have to explain why.

21
01:47.490 --> 01:48.890
Hand it in to me by today.

22
01:54.390 --> 02:07.110
[Boy, with Caution] [Episode 2]

23
02:07.190 --> 02:10.110
[Unfortunately, it seems I need you, Regret, this time.]

24
02:08.030 --> 02:11.880
Unfortunately, it seems I need you, Regret, this time.

25
02:12.210 --> 02:14.860
Mr. Jang, you seem very busy every lunch break.

26
02:15.590 --> 02:16.520
Tell me about it.

27
02:16.880 --> 02:18.810
Something always comes up at noon.

28
02:19.930 --> 02:21.070
Speaking of which,

29
02:21.540 --> 02:23.540
did Hyunjae really steal the phone?

30
02:24.250 --> 02:25.280
It's hard to say.

31
02:26.510 --> 02:29.200
Didn't they find the phone in his backpack?

32
02:32.360 --> 02:35.090
Sometimes kids from wealthy families just go astray

33
02:35.090 --> 02:36.200
in this way.

34
02:38.000 --> 02:39.530
We should talk to him first.

35
02:40.430 --> 02:42.190
What's there to talk about?

36
02:44.060 --> 02:46.150
Just submit it to the disciplinary committee.

37
02:46.150 --> 02:48.150
The chairman will handle it anyway.

38
02:59.030 --> 03:00.000
Are you leaving?

39
03:00.440 --> 03:03.300
I have to talk to Youngmoon about his college plans.

40
03:08.090 --> 03:10.340
I'm already starting to dislike him.

41
03:11.180 --> 03:13.180
You know this kind of person, right?

42
03:13.910 --> 03:16.510
They never look back no matter what others say.

43
03:27.010 --> 03:29.100
That guy emptied his backpack,

44
03:29.230 --> 03:31.000
and my phone appeared right there.

45
03:31.000 --> 03:33.200
Why are you still treating me like this?

46
03:33.530 --> 03:35.940
Mr. Jang, you came late, so you might not know.

47
03:35.940 --> 03:38.250
Do you know why he's older than us?

48
03:38.420 --> 03:40.880
Rumor has it he was expelled for doing drugs.

49
03:41.140 --> 03:42.700
He was selling drugs at school.

50
03:42.700 --> 03:43.600
So what?

51
03:43.760 --> 03:45.230
Are you checking for drugs?

52
03:45.230 --> 03:46.120
Huh?

53
03:47.640 --> 03:49.970
I see similar problems every exam period,

54
03:50.110 --> 03:51.620
whether in the first year

55
03:52.370 --> 03:53.670
or the second year.

56
03:56.690 --> 03:59.350
The offending students all have drug problems.

57
04:04.310 --> 04:05.300
Mr. Jang,

58
04:05.510 --> 04:07.820
doesn't it say I'm the victim there?

59
04:08.080 --> 04:10.340
Those bastards are the ones doing drugs.

60
04:10.360 --> 04:12.090
What does that have to do with this?

61
04:12.090 --> 04:14.540
Those bastards are doing drugs,

62
04:14.950 --> 04:17.550
but you're the one with your grades improving.

63
04:19.260 --> 04:22.920
I'm asking you what that has to do with this.

64
04:28.870 --> 04:30.530
I'll report it to the disciplinary committee

65
04:30.530 --> 04:32.590
if Hyunjae admits he stole the phone.

66
04:33.659 --> 04:34.620
Mr. Jang,

67
04:35.250 --> 04:37.510
you know he's the chairman's son, right?

68
04:37.990 --> 04:42.710
So is this about taking sides or special treatment?

69
04:45.580 --> 04:46.659
That's right.

70
04:47.340 --> 04:49.000
If you're done, you can leave.

71
04:49.390 --> 04:50.920
Tell Hyunjae to come see me.

72
04:56.650 --> 04:57.980
Should I open it for you?

73
05:08.210 --> 05:09.760
Just give him the money.

74
05:09.950 --> 05:11.090
To Choi Youngmoon.

75
05:11.910 --> 05:13.970
I heard you clash with him every time.

76
05:15.290 --> 05:17.290
Did you call me over just to say this?

77
05:18.350 --> 05:20.920
It's because you keep making mistakes.

78
05:21.410 --> 05:23.540
Do you know how many eyes are watching?

79
05:24.270 --> 05:28.200
If you make a scene again, do you think the chairman won't hear about it?

80
05:28.860 --> 05:30.590
Then don't let the news spread.

81
05:30.840 --> 05:33.640
Just pretend you don't know anything about my dad.

82
05:35.360 --> 05:36.500
I...

83
05:36.900 --> 05:39.120
I'm always on your side.

84
05:40.510 --> 05:41.450
But

85
05:41.830 --> 05:44.130
your new homeroom teacher

86
05:45.100 --> 05:46.300
is a contract worker,

87
05:46.470 --> 05:48.200
and that's all he has ever been.

88
05:49.860 --> 05:50.890
So?

89
05:51.130 --> 05:53.860
You're so smart, why play dumb at a time like this?

90
05:57.200 --> 05:59.610
There's nothing to worry about.

91
06:00.830 --> 06:02.410
You know what I mean.

92
06:03.410 --> 06:05.850
Once you're reported to the disciplinary committee,

93
06:05.850 --> 06:08.950
I won't be able to cover for you.

94
06:10.170 --> 06:12.030
When have you ever covered for me?

95
06:14.500 --> 06:16.030
I need to go get some advice.

96
06:17.100 --> 06:18.270
What advice?

97
06:19.760 --> 06:21.490
Didn't you want me to pay for it?

98
06:23.000 --> 06:24.160
Fine, fine.

99
06:25.710 --> 06:27.980
You're too rebellious sometimes.

100
06:28.840 --> 06:32.080
How much is a phone worth? Is it worth stealing?

101
06:32.430 --> 06:33.890
You're not short of money.

102
06:36.560 --> 06:37.870
Tell me about it.

103
06:51.520 --> 06:55.300
[There are some things you can only talk about with complete strangers. Don't you have anything like that, Regret?]

104
06:53.830 --> 06:57.760
There are some things you can only talk about with complete strangers.

105
06:58.060 --> 07:00.460
Don't you have anything like that, Regret?

106
07:20.850 --> 07:23.270
Of course.

107
07:30.310 --> 07:32.500
Sometimes I want to run away too.

108
07:35.100 --> 07:36.080
Run away?

109
07:54.530 --> 07:55.570
You're here.

110
08:04.420 --> 08:07.060
Can I sit for a while? I don't have class either.

111
08:12.160 --> 08:15.590
Aren't you bored being alone in a place like this?

112
08:16.980 --> 08:18.840
If it's boring, then just stop...

113
08:19.460 --> 08:20.790
going to school.

114
08:31.980 --> 08:33.220
It's not like that.

115
08:37.030 --> 08:38.559
I've never found it boring.

116
08:39.280 --> 08:42.409
Then why haven't you submitted your intention form yet?

117
08:43.390 --> 08:45.760
I can't fill it out.

118
08:46.920 --> 08:48.330
What's so hard about it?

119
08:50.790 --> 08:52.050
The reason.

120
08:53.930 --> 08:57.460
You asked me to write clearly why I don't have anything to write.

121
08:57.610 --> 09:00.670
Because the reason is too embarrassing to show anyone?

122
09:03.800 --> 09:06.600
Because I have to make one up since I don't have one.

123
09:07.220 --> 09:09.100
I stole that phone.

124
09:09.900 --> 09:11.760
I just need to pay him back, right?

125
09:13.250 --> 09:14.300
Why?

126
09:16.290 --> 09:17.690
Why did you steal it?

127
09:19.190 --> 09:20.720
Does that need a reason too?

128
09:21.140 --> 09:22.150
Yes.

129
09:24.770 --> 09:26.860
After all, a phone is not a pen cap.

130
09:45.740 --> 09:48.370
I feel like you haven't had lunch.

131
09:48.670 --> 09:51.530
Eat this and give me the form today.

132
09:52.880 --> 09:54.210
The intention form.

133
09:56.420 --> 09:57.440
Okay.

134
09:58.620 --> 10:00.470
If you don't want to talk about it,

135
10:00.470 --> 10:03.730
you can write the reason for stealing the phone on the form.

136
10:04.620 --> 10:05.740
I'm leaving.

137
10:07.380 --> 10:08.330
Mr. Jang.

138
10:12.260 --> 10:14.710
Have you always been like this?

139
10:17.950 --> 10:23.750
I'm just curious if you treat all students like this.

140
10:27.590 --> 10:29.520
This is special treatment for you.

141
10:30.670 --> 10:32.470
Because I'm the chairman's son?

142
10:33.380 --> 10:34.560
No,

143
10:35.650 --> 10:38.580
because you look like you don't care about anything.

144
10:39.390 --> 10:41.450
Only students like that act this way—

145
10:42.170 --> 10:43.480
students like you.

146
10:45.890 --> 10:46.860
I'm leaving.

147
10:49.230 --> 10:51.360
Make sure you go to the nurse's office.

148
11:24.020 --> 11:24.920
Continue.

149
11:35.130 --> 11:37.260
You didn't go to the hospital, did you?

150
11:39.150 --> 11:42.750
You're not allowed to train until you get a medical certificate.

151
11:43.290 --> 11:44.180
I'll try again.

152
11:44.330 --> 11:46.020
What if you ruin your wrist?

153
11:46.290 --> 11:47.490
I'll be careful.

154
11:48.080 --> 11:50.310
Why are you so arrogant?

155
11:52.520 --> 11:55.000
To participate in the competition, you use sponsorships to pay your tuition.

156
11:55.000 --> 11:57.500
At least learn to work hard, you brat!

157
12:00.210 --> 12:03.260
Do you think you get sponsorships because you're good?

158
12:03.260 --> 12:04.440
Sorry.

159
12:18.720 --> 12:21.080
[Grandma's Hospital]

160
12:27.710 --> 12:30.190
Are you Lee Jungnam's family?

161
12:32.400 --> 12:33.840
This is the hospital.

162
12:34.300 --> 12:35.170
Yeah.

163
12:37.970 --> 12:39.390
What's wrong with my grandmother?

164
12:39.390 --> 12:43.260
Ah, your grandmother's condition hasn't improved.

165
12:43.450 --> 12:46.850
I'm calling you about transferring her to another hospital.

166
12:48.540 --> 12:49.600
[Hello, this is Nakwon University Hospital. We are writing to inform you the outstanding treatment balance for the patient currently hospitalized at our facility.]

167
12:49.600 --> 12:50.670
[Patient Name: Lee Jungnam; Balance: 1,286,540 KRW; Payment Deadline: May 31st; Payment Method: Visit the administration office or make a bank transfer.]

168
12:50.670 --> 12:51.620
[To ensure smooth treatment and administration, please make the payment by the due date. If you have any questions, please contact the hospital administration office. Thank you.]

169
12:54.360 --> 12:55.420
Do you want one?

170
12:55.580 --> 12:56.900
Get to the point.

171
12:58.220 --> 12:59.270
Lee Hyunjae.

172
13:00.530 --> 13:02.390
I'm not telling you to kill him.

173
13:02.650 --> 13:06.870
Just make his face a little bloody.

174
13:07.460 --> 13:10.400
It's too obvious that Jang Kiwoo is giving him special treatment.

175
13:10.400 --> 13:12.000
Don't you think I'm wronged?

176
13:13.370 --> 13:14.570
How much will you give me?

177
13:14.570 --> 13:16.480
That's right, Jungha.

178
13:16.610 --> 13:17.990
You'll do it for me anyway.

179
13:17.990 --> 13:19.190
Why make me so scared?

180
13:19.260 --> 13:21.040
How much do you want for doing it?

181
13:21.040 --> 13:22.060
One million.

182
13:22.850 --> 13:24.100
Okay, one million it is.

183
13:24.100 --> 13:26.230
Okay, exactly.

184
13:30.930 --> 13:32.660
You pay half in advance, right?

185
13:33.860 --> 13:34.860
Wait a minute.

186
13:36.790 --> 13:37.950
But Jungha.

187
13:38.870 --> 13:42.330
You're not going to hit Lee Hyunjae with that face, are you?

188
13:43.910 --> 13:45.370
Just promise me one thing.

189
13:45.780 --> 13:48.110
If your identity is exposed,

190
13:48.380 --> 13:50.080
this has nothing to do with me.

191
13:52.470 --> 13:54.000
You know what I mean, right?

192
13:57.740 --> 13:58.440
What? What?

193
13:58.590 --> 13:59.840
What are you smiling at?

194
13:59.840 --> 14:03.000
Hiding in the back, not wanting to suffer any loss—

195
14:04.060 --> 14:05.740
you look funny like that.

196
14:07.880 --> 14:09.700
It's a promise, right?

197
14:13.890 --> 14:16.020
I just transferred 500,000 won to you.

198
14:16.760 --> 14:18.850
Don't let me suffer a loss.

199
14:32.130 --> 14:33.340
Were you waiting for me?

200
14:33.340 --> 14:34.280
Yeah.

201
14:34.420 --> 14:36.550
I didn't want to eat alone.

202
14:47.700 --> 14:49.240
Your wrist...

203
14:50.200 --> 14:51.490
it still hurts, right?

204
14:52.760 --> 14:53.640
Hey.

205
14:55.040 --> 14:57.500
Do you want me to tell you something I regret?

206
15:02.970 --> 15:06.580
Since I was injured, I might as well have been injured more seriously and asked for more money,

207
15:06.580 --> 15:08.250
so I could send my grandmother to a nursing hospital.

208
15:08.250 --> 15:09.200
Hey.

209
15:10.160 --> 15:12.490
Except for this, I have nothing to regret.

210
15:14.090 --> 15:15.460
It's not your fault.

211
15:18.380 --> 15:19.460
Give me a cola.

212
15:40.280 --> 15:41.350
What is this?

213
15:48.310 --> 15:48.960
Hey.

214
15:49.130 --> 15:52.460
The money you lent me when my grandmother was hospitalized.

215
15:52.510 --> 15:54.310
I'll give you the rest next week.

216
15:54.540 --> 15:56.170
Where did this money come from?

217
15:56.170 --> 15:57.250
Part-time job.

218
15:57.520 --> 15:59.850
I don't believe this part-time job stuff.

219
16:00.840 --> 16:02.080
It's real.

220
16:02.260 --> 16:04.070
I started delivering food.

221
16:05.170 --> 16:06.780
Stop doing it.

222
16:07.250 --> 16:09.350
I don't know what it is, but stop doing it—

223
16:09.350 --> 16:10.750
what you are doing now.

224
16:14.280 --> 16:15.410
Are you done eating?

225
16:23.760 --> 16:24.860
Lend it to me.

226
16:25.000 --> 16:25.770
Kim Jungha.

227
16:26.000 --> 16:27.230
This is the last time.

228
16:29.850 --> 16:31.140
I'll never do it again.

229
16:49.950 --> 16:55.980
[Dad]

230
16:56.930 --> 16:58.790
School's been out for a while now.

231
17:03.850 --> 17:05.180
What are you doing here?

232
17:07.920 --> 17:09.000
Running away.

233
17:16.619 --> 17:18.349
The college application form—

234
17:18.700 --> 17:20.740
I was going to hand it in today.

235
17:21.980 --> 17:25.180
When I think about making up a reason, I can't think of one.

236
17:25.680 --> 17:29.540
Just fill in "none" if you have nothing. Who told you to make things up?

237
17:38.020 --> 17:39.240
The phone.

238
17:43.350 --> 17:45.440
I didn't steal it.

239
17:50.160 --> 17:51.240
I know.

240
17:58.000 --> 17:59.800
The chairman is looking for you.

241
18:00.600 --> 18:01.830
See you tomorrow.

242
18:04.580 --> 18:06.760
It's getting late. Stop running away.

243
18:46.540 --> 18:47.590
Is he in his room?

244
18:47.980 --> 18:48.860
Yes.

245
19:02.070 --> 19:04.160
What? You stole a phone?

246
19:05.390 --> 19:07.120
Don't you have anything to say?

247
19:08.210 --> 19:09.210
No.

248
19:14.400 --> 19:16.960
Did I tell you to behave like you were dead?

249
19:17.120 --> 19:18.380
Is it that hard?

250
19:18.540 --> 19:20.000
You're really something.

251
19:20.100 --> 19:22.630
Ruining my mood over something so worthless.

252
19:23.450 --> 19:25.510
Are you going to stay silent forever?

253
19:26.350 --> 19:27.470
Speak.

254
19:28.130 --> 19:31.390
Wasn't 2 whole years of reflection in the hospital enough?

255
19:31.830 --> 19:33.430
I told you to speak, you brat!

256
19:34.830 --> 19:35.910
What?

257
19:36.050 --> 19:39.580
Did you want to sell the phone to give your mom some pocket money?

258
19:44.330 --> 19:47.340
Do you even remember what my mom looks like when you say that?

259
19:47.340 --> 19:49.090
Hey, you brat!

260
19:49.770 --> 19:51.790
If you know to pity your mom,

261
19:51.940 --> 19:55.120
you shouldn't be shaming me like this.

262
19:57.450 --> 19:59.600
What else can I do?

263
20:05.690 --> 20:06.960
Dongjin!

264
20:08.060 --> 20:10.100
Go for a drive and come back.

265
21:05.260 --> 21:07.900
What's going on? Why didn't you send me a picture of you beating him?

266
21:07.900 --> 21:08.900
Just go.

267
21:09.710 --> 21:10.990
It went well, right?

268
21:12.000 --> 21:13.820
I already paid you an advance.

269
21:14.000 --> 21:15.280
I told you to get lost.

270
21:15.890 --> 21:16.640
Hey, Kim Jungha.

271
21:16.640 --> 21:17.900
He told you to get lost.

272
21:20.350 --> 21:21.880
Class is starting.

273
21:39.870 --> 21:41.540
I won't take attendance.

274
21:43.430 --> 21:44.560
Mr. Jang.

275
21:45.490 --> 21:47.130
Hyunjae isn't here yet.

276
21:47.660 --> 21:48.720
I know.

277
21:49.800 --> 21:52.000
It's Jiyoon's turn for college counseling.

278
21:52.000 --> 21:53.730
Come to the office after lunch.

279
21:53.870 --> 21:55.660
If Hyunjae shows up, let me know.

280
21:55.660 --> 21:56.510
That's all.

281
22:10.240 --> 22:11.430
Mr. Jang.

282
22:11.590 --> 22:13.360
Shall we talk?

283
22:18.650 --> 22:19.910
Coffee is fine, right?

284
22:21.350 --> 22:22.470
Yeah.

285
22:25.160 --> 22:27.400
I'll get straight to the point.

286
22:27.800 --> 22:29.330
About the phone incident—

287
22:29.740 --> 22:32.920
it's best if you let him and Youngmoon settle it.

288
22:33.080 --> 22:34.510
Don't worry about it.

289
22:35.240 --> 22:37.830
But it seems Hyunjae didn't steal it.

290
22:38.600 --> 22:41.420
What if he admits he stole it?

291
22:43.490 --> 22:45.730
Just let them handle it themselves.

292
22:46.430 --> 22:49.430
Sometimes if you don't fit in, you don't.

293
22:49.590 --> 22:52.570
If you can't adapt, you can't.

294
22:52.970 --> 22:56.410
I hope you can let Hyunjae graduate peacefully.

295
22:59.100 --> 23:01.100
Is this a request from the chairman?

296
23:03.510 --> 23:06.770
Just mark him as sick today.

297
23:12.560 --> 23:13.970
Running away.

298
23:18.530 --> 23:19.910
The reason?

299
23:20.660 --> 23:23.860
What reason do you need for sick leave, Mr. Jang?

300
23:46.000 --> 23:47.250
You're still here.

301
23:52.800 --> 23:59.400
[Nakwon High School College Application Form]

302
24:02.940 --> 24:04.670
I'm a day late.

303
24:05.600 --> 24:08.210
You told me to hand it in by yesterday.

304
24:11.680 --> 24:13.800
I didn't expect you to be so obedient.

305
24:17.610 --> 24:18.520
I'm off.

306
24:18.750 --> 24:19.650
Hyunjae.

307
24:23.320 --> 24:24.810
Are you free right now?

308
24:44.280 --> 24:45.280
You...

309
24:47.030 --> 24:48.750
These bruises you got...

310
24:51.930 --> 24:53.460
Were they all from your dad?

311
25:01.120 --> 25:02.320
Get some counseling.

312
25:02.510 --> 25:05.570
I'll arrange a professional senior counselor for you.

313
25:06.040 --> 25:08.570
Every... Thursday.

314
25:09.560 --> 25:10.690
Is that okay?

315
25:11.420 --> 25:12.440
No.

316
25:13.540 --> 25:15.540
I'm not giving you a choice.

317
25:17.750 --> 25:20.750
I don't want to talk about my business with a stranger.

318
25:23.100 --> 25:25.020
If I have to talk...

319
25:26.590 --> 25:28.310
Can I talk about it with you?

320
25:49.040 --> 25:50.370
I'm locking up the door.

321
25:52.230 --> 25:54.030
Did the nurse contact you?

322
25:54.470 --> 25:55.300
Yes.

323
25:56.200 --> 25:57.740
Is there anyone else inside?

324
25:57.740 --> 25:59.020
My student.

325
26:00.910 --> 26:02.040
I suppose I could...

326
26:02.090 --> 26:03.340
Regret,

327
26:02.380 --> 26:06.810
[Regret, shall we meet?]

328
26:03.780 --> 26:05.220
shall we meet?

329
26:07.150 --> 26:09.330
-Is it the student inside? -Yes.

330
26:09.790 --> 26:10.990
We're still talking.

331
26:11.230 --> 26:12.220
Wait a moment.

332
26:12.340 --> 26:14.240
Give me the key. I'll lock the door.

333
26:14.240 --> 26:14.830
Here.

334
26:14.260 --> 26:20.870
[There are some things you can only talk about with complete strangers.] [Of course. There are times I want to run away too.]

335
26:14.840 --> 26:16.940
Of course.

336
26:17.980 --> 26:20.040
There are times I want to run away too.

337
26:22.250 --> 26:24.170
I feel so pathetic.

338
26:24.800 --> 26:27.100
Even talking to you about this

339
26:27.360 --> 26:29.760
seems like a way of running away to me.

340
26:39.950 --> 26:41.450
Let's talk about the rest tomorrow.

341
26:41.450 --> 26:43.510
-It's getting late today. -Mr. Jang.

342
26:45.390 --> 26:47.590
I want to talk to you.

343
27:00.630 --> 27:06.040
[Boy, with Caution]

344
27:06.080 --> 27:07.070
What are you doing?

345
27:07.070 --> 27:07.870
Are you crazy?

346
27:08.100 --> 27:10.140
If you want to see if I'm really crazy,

347
27:10.140 --> 27:11.810
try calling Jang Kiwoo's name one more time.

348
27:11.810 --> 27:13.510
You said you were willing to accept counseling.

349
27:13.510 --> 27:14.770
Was that because of me?

350
27:14.890 --> 27:15.970
Is that not okay?

351
27:16.140 --> 27:17.830
Didn't I tell you

352
27:18.200 --> 27:21.260
to let Hyunjae handle it himself as much as possible?

353
27:21.520 --> 27:24.090
I want to ask why.

354
27:25.030 --> 27:26.020
Mr. Jang.

355
27:26.150 --> 27:27.950
You have a precedent, don't you?

356
27:28.500 --> 27:29.340
Hit me.

357
27:29.530 --> 27:30.720
I told you to hit me.

358
27:31.150 --> 27:32.390
I'll take it.

359
27:35.000 --> 27:37.290
I really am getting special treatment, right?

360
27:37.290 --> 27:38.390
Still?
